  "description": "Ju Yeon-Ho, who works as a tutor at a cram school. An Ji-Hye,a student he met during private lessons four years ago, has returned—completely transformed!?\n\nA nerve-wracking living arrangement that began unexpectedly due to circumstances… Gone are the days of her diligence and intelligence, Ji-Hye has turned into a complete airhead! \n\nCan the immature Ji-Hye grow into a “mature adult”?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
